  "html": "<div class=\"screen-runtime\"><div class=\"prototype-screen\"><div class=\"screen-slot screen-slot--header\" data-slot=\"header\"><header class=\"topbar\"><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\" alt=\"\"><span>AdvogadoJá</span></header></div><div class=\"screen-layout\"><div class=\"screen-slot screen-slot--main\" data-slot=\"main\"><div class=\"registration__shell\"><div class=\"registration__intro\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">Criar conta</p><h1>Acesso e segurança</h1><p>Defina a senha da conta vinculada ao e-mail informado.</p></div><div class=\"progress\" aria-label=\"Etapa 5 de 7\"><span></span></div><form class=\"form-card\" data-registration-form=\"\"><div class=\"field\"><input id=\"reg-password\" name=\"password\" type=\"password\" placeholder=\" \" autocomplete=\"new-password\" data-reg-field=\"password\" minlength=\"8\" required><label for=\"reg-password\">Senha</label></div><div class=\"field\"><input id=\"reg-password-confirm\" name=\"passwordConfirmation\" type=\"password\" placeholder=\" \" autocomplete=\"new-password\" data-reg-field=\"passwordConfirmation\" minlength=\"8\" required><label for=\"reg-password-confirm\">Confirmar senha</label></div><div class=\"form-note\"><strong>Conta</strong><span>O tipo escolhido no início do cadastro será salvo junto à conta para orientar os próximos acessos e o onboarding correto.</span></div><div class=\"form-actions\"><button class=\"secondary-action\" type=\"button\" data-action=\"navegar.auth.cadastro.endereco\">Voltar</button><button class=\"button\" type=\"submit\" data-action=\"navegar.auth.cadastro.consentimentos\">Continuar</button></div><p class=\"form-status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p></form></div></div></div></div></div>",
